charactercheck

Independent implementation. Schema semantics for the D&D Beyond
character-service v5 payload were partly informed by reading the source of
MrPrimate/ddb-importer (MIT, Copyright (c) 2019 Sebastian Will, (c) 2020 Jack
Holloway). The initial pinned offline adapter registry was independently
observed and cross-checked against that project's fallback registry; narrow
mapping facts and its snapshot/fallback design were adapted with attribution.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The 100-row Coverage Inventory was authored by the
project owner and is an extraction inventory, not rules validation.

