CharacterCheck modifies selected SRD 5.2.1 material by representing feat
categories, class classifications, and multiclass spell-slot progression as
partial executable lookup data and identifiers. It does not reproduce the SRD
as a whole. Project code remains under the MIT License; this notice does not
